  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (10 minutes): take 1d6 Humanity Loss, returned if you avoid the Secondary Effect. Once per Round, spend an Action or Move Action to look through the hallucinations and get a hint from the GM about a character, plot element, or something else in the scene. NPCs can do the same against you. Secondary (DV19): addiction. While addicted and not on Glitter: INT and TECH -2 (minimum 1) and +1 Base Death Save Penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"Glitter Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>When an addicted character doses, use \"Glitter Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
